<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>internal<sp/>loopback<sp/>test<sp/>mode<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>UART<sp/>module.<sp/>This</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">is<sp/>a<sp/>very<sp/>basic<sp/>loopback<sp/>that<sp/>does<sp/>not<sp/>use<sp/>the<sp/>FIFOs<sp/>or<sp/>interrupts.<sp/>Data<sp/>is<sp/>sent</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">byte<sp/>by<sp/>byte,<sp/>then<sp/>compared<sp/>to<sp/>received<sp/>data<sp/>in<sp/>an<sp/>infinite<sp/>loop.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>pinmux<sp/>and<sp/>UART<sp/>modules<sp/>are<sp/>configured<sp/>through<sp/>the<sp/>sysconfig<sp/>file.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>sent<sp/>data<sp/>looks<sp/>like<sp/>this:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\code</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0x01<sp/>0x02<sp/>0x03<sp/>0x04<sp/>0x05<sp/>0x06<sp/>0x07<sp/>....<sp/>0xFE<sp/>0xFF<sp/>0x00</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>pattern<sp/>is<sp/>repeated<sp/>forever.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>Avoid<sp/>keeping<sp/>the<sp/>memory<sp/>browser<sp/>open<sp/>while<sp/>the<sp/>execution<sp/>is<sp/>in<sp/>progress.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F29H85x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Watch<sp/><sp/>Variables</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>sData<sp/>:<sp/>Data<sp/>to<sp/>send</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>rData<sp/>:<sp/>Received<sp/>data</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>External<sp/>Connections</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>None</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28E12x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Watch<sp/><sp/>Variables</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>sData<sp/>:<sp/>Data<sp/>being<sp/>sent</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>rData<sp/>:<sp/>Data<sp/>received</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>loopCount<sp/>:<sp/>Number<sp/>of<sp/>characters<sp/>sent</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>errorCount<sp/>:<sp/>Number<sp/>of<sp/>errors<sp/>detected</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>External<sp/>Connections</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Connect<sp/>the<sp/>UARTA<sp/>Rx<sp/>port<sp/>to<sp/>Tx<sp/>port<sp/>for<sp/>external<sp/>loopback.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>GPIO32<sp/>is<sp/>UARTARX<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>connected<sp/>to<sp/>GPIO43<sp/>is<sp/>UARTATX</highlight></codeline>
